# WHY: the working copy is Windows and CI is Ubuntu. Without this, git converts
# to CRLF on checkout here while Prettier's default endOfLine is lf, so
# `npm run format:check` passes locally and fails in CI on the same commit.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
# Fonts carry stray CR and LF bytes; if the text rule above ever stops
# auto-detecting, a checkout would rewrite them and corrupt the face.
*.woff2 binary
